{"id":"discurso","lemma":"discurso","pos":"noun","rank":1366,"glosses":["discourse","speech"],"ipa":"/disˈkuɾso/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"discursos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/db/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-discurso.wav","examples":[{"text":"Su discurso nos conmovió.","en":"His speech moved us.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450162"},{"text":"Estoy ocupado escribiendo cartas y pronunciando discursos.","en":"I'm busy with writing letters and giving speeches.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705380"},{"text":"¿Cómo salió tu discurso?","en":"How did your speech go?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461803"},{"text":"No estoy acostumbrado a hacer discursos en público.","en":"I'm not used to making speeches in public.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608631"},{"text":"¿Debo dar un discurso?","en":"Do I have to make a speech?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735802"}]}